s://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000120/extras/Hunt_the_Leviathan_2.png?t=1740151812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are being watched.</strong> The Leviathan, a cosmic force of death, will try to consume you after seven days on the water. At first, you won't be able to stop it; you're a mere mortal, and it's an infinite eldritch being. <strong>However, you have an advantage: a billion-dollar cosmic debt</strong> which returns you from the dead. With each new run, you grow stronger. The Leviathan is hunting you. <strong>Hunt it back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000120/extras/As_above_so_below_2.png?t=1740151812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The weapons at your disposal are as varied and chaotic as the fish you're fighting. <strong>Recruit fish into your skeleton army</strong> after thwacking them with a giant anchor. <strong>Ram into sea monsters head-on,</strong> then heal up using a magic lure. As you catch stronger and stronger fish that want to eat you, only smart build-crafting can keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000120/extras/Gradt_2.png?t=1740151812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eventually you'll make a mistake. You'll get too greedy, bring too many fish up at once, and get swarmed and destroyed. With each new run, you'll learn a little more, unlock more upgrades for the future, and get closer to your true goal: <strong>slay the Leviathan, pay off your cosmic debt, and become the greatest battle-fisherman of all time.</strong></p>","developers":["HEATHER FLOWERS"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a